   "text": "Per arm: means over the 36 development scenes (seeds averaged) of OPR, mIoU and RA (OWLv2) and PickScore. score = mean(OPR, mIoU, RA) + 0.05 x (PickScore - PickScore of the original OCSD). Eligible: at least 95% of the images exist and PickScore >= that of the original OCSD (not less natural by the proxy). The eligible arm with the highest score is frozen; ties go to the earlier arm in the candidate list. If no arm is eligible, the complete arm with the highest score is frozen and this is reported. If PickScore is unavailable, the score is the structure mean alone.",
